{
  "about": "Model names the host accepts and refuses. Read by tests/test_model_names.py against the protocol rule (lico_protocol/v1.py) and by a unit test in folders.rs against valid_model, so the two rules cannot drift apart. An entry is `text`, or `unit` repeated `times`. The limit is 60 bytes; every refused text above it is also refused for its characters.",
  "valid": [
    {"text": "sonnet", "why": "an alias"},
